# Store and check out text files with LF on every platform.
#
# The repository's release gates hash raw file bytes (scripts/verify-generated-source-set.mjs and
# scripts/generate-sbom.mjs --check), and CI runs on Linux. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF, so `pnpm build` and `pnpm test` fail locally even though the
# committed content is correct. Binary files are detected automatically and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
